!eclmap
!ins_signatures
# Touhou Toolkit release 12 incorrectly uses TH18.5's nine-integer
# signature for opcode 535 when compiling TH18.  TH18's diffI form is
# (destination, easy, normal, hard, lunatic), as documented by the TH18
# eclmap and every original TH18 declaration in this corpus.
535 SSSSS
